{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15092","headline":"赋得花发上林 · 王储","name":"赋得花发上林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东陆和风至，先开上苑花。\n穠枝藏宿鸟，香蘂拂行车。\n散白怜睛日，舒红爱晚霞。\n桃间留御马，梅处入胡笳。\n城郭连增媚，楼台映转华。\n岂同幽谷草，春至发犹赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王储","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}